# Planning notes. Most of docs-notes/ is raw working material and stays local;
# the files a reader needs to follow the repo's own truth-source chain are
# committed. `docs-notes/*` (not `docs-notes/`) is required: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
docs-notes/*
!docs-notes/CYCLEBEAT_PLAN_V3.md
!docs-notes/CYCLEBEAT_PLAN_V3.2.md
!docs-notes/CYCLEBEAT_PLAN_V3.2.fr.md
!docs-notes/CYCLEBEAT_ROADMAP.md
!docs-notes/DECISIONS_SESSION_2026-07.md
!docs-notes/PEER_REVIEW.md

BACKLOG.md
ROADMAP_V1_RENFORCEE.md
ROADMAP_V2_FULL.md
chatgpt.md

